</head>
<body>
<div class="shell">
<nav aria-label="Main"><a href="index.php">Chloe Reads Jon</a><span>A small world of time</span></nav>
<header class="masthead"><h1>Zulu Post</h1><p>Six letters. One shared clock.<br>Can you get the mail there at just the right local time?</p></header>
<figure class="cover"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1200" height="800" alt="An orange paper mail plane carries an envelope above miniature islands of Vancouver, London, Tokyo and Auckland."><figcaption><span>Across the ocean. Occasionally into tomorrow.</span><span>Illustrated air-mail adventures</span></figcaption></figure>
<noscript><p>This game needs JavaScript. Enable it to adjust the clock and deliver the letters.</p></noscript>
<div class="postmarks"><p id="progress">Your postal route</p><ol id="stamps" aria-label="Delivery progress"></ol></div>
<main>
<div class="work" id="game">
<article class="letter" aria-labelledby="missionTitle">
<h2 id="missionTitle" tabindex="-1"></h2>
<p id="story"></p>
<div class="route"><div><small>From</small><strong id="from"></strong><small id="fromOffset"></small></div><svg width="28" height="24" viewBox="0 0 28 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12h23M17 4l8 8-8 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div><small>To</small><strong id="to"></strong><small id="toOffset"></small></div></div>
<p class="request">Please deliver at <strong class="target" id="target"></strong><span class="local" id="localTarget"></span></p>
<p id="duration"></p>
<span id="cancel" hidden>DELIVERED<br><small>ZULU POST</small></span>
<small class="note">Fictional mail routes and flight times. The listed UTC offsets stay fixed for every puzzle.</small>
</article>
<section class="dial" aria-label="Set the departure clock">
<div class="date-row"><label for="day">UTC departure day</label><select id="day"><option value="0">Monday 16 Nov</option><option value="1">Tuesday 17 Nov</option></select></div>
<output class="clock" id="clock" for="time day"></output>
<label for="time">Choose a departure time</label>
<div class="scrub"><button type="button" id="back" aria-label="15 minutes earlier">−</button><input type="range" id="time" min="0" max="1425" step="15" value="720" aria-label="UTC departure time"><button type="button" id="forward" aria-label="15 minutes later">+</button></div>
<div class="range-ends" aria-hidden="true"><span>00:00</span><span>23:45</span></div>
<div class="departure"><span id="departureLabel"></span><strong id="departure"></strong></div>
<p>Pick the UTC day and time, then open the arrival seal. Adjust and try as often as you like.</p>
<div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="check" type="button">Check arrival</button><button id="hint" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hintText">Show a hint</button></div>
<p id="hintText" hidden></p>
<div id="feedback" class="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden><p id="result"></p><p id="arrival"></p><button id="next" type="button" hidden>Next letter</button></div>
</section>
</div>
<section id="finish" class="finish" hidden aria-labelledby="finishTitle"><h2 id="finishTitle" tabindex="-1">All six, right on time.</h2><p>You carried breakfast plans, a midnight surprise, and a rather determined parcel through the world's clocks. Nobody had to eat yesterday's cake.</p><p id="summary"></p><ul id="log"></ul><button type="button" id="replay">Fly the route again</button></section>
<section class="lesson" aria-labelledby="lessonTitle"><div><h2 id="lessonTitle">Why “Zulu”?</h2><p>Pilots use “Zulu” for UTC, the shared clock that keeps different local times from getting mixed up. UTC doesn't jump forward or back for daylight saving.</p><p>Jon's idea was simple: put GMT on your watch's second clock. For these minute-level puzzles, GMT and UTC show the same time.</p></div><div><h2>The little clock trick</h2><p>Start with UTC, add the flight, then add the destination's offset. If you pass midnight, change the day too.</p><details><summary>Show the backwards shortcut</summary><p>Work backwards from the requested local arrival. Subtract the destination's UTC offset to get UTC arrival, then subtract the flight time. A negative offset means you add when working backwards. Kathmandu's +05:45 includes 45 minutes.</p></details></div></section>
</main>
<footer><p>Inspired by Jon's <a href="?source=1">Tip: Set secondary clock to GMT</a>, May 14, 2009.</p><p>Made for a small adventure together. No score to beat, no clock to race.</p></footer>
</div>
<script>
'use strict';
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
const cities={
 v:{name:'Vancouver',offset:-420},l:{name:'London',offset:0},t:{name:'Tokyo',offset:540},
 a:{name:'Auckland',offset:780},k:{name:'Kathmandu',offset:345},s:{name:"St. John's",offset:-210}
};
const missions=[
 {title:'The breakfast letter',story:'A friend in London wants to open your letter with the first cup of tea.',from:'v',to:'l',flight:540,target:540,theme:'A straightforward start.'},
 {title:'The midnight departure',story:'A birthday envelope leaves Tokyo. Can it arrive in Vancouver on Monday afternoon?',from:'t',to:'v',flight:540,target:1020,theme:'One instant can have two different dates.'},
 {title:'Tomorrow in Tokyo',story:'The little bookshop opens at eight. Your letter should be waiting at the door.',from:'l',to:'t',flight:720,target:1920,theme:'Remember to move the calendar too.'},
 {title:'Across the date line',story:'An Auckland breakfast club is expecting a postcard from Tokyo. There is toast at stake.',from:'t',to:'a',flight:180,target:1920,theme:'A positive offset can carry you into tomorrow.'},
 {title:'The quarter-hour parcel',story:'A clockmaker in Kathmandu asked for a delivery at precisely quarter past nine.',from:'l',to:'k',flight:480,target:1995,theme:'Some offsets have minutes, not just hours.'},
 {title:'The long way to teatime',story:"One last letter, from Auckland to St. John's. A half-hour offset is hiding at the far end.",from:'a',to:'s',flight:1080,target:2640,theme:'Check both the departure day and the half hour.'}
];
const dayNames=['Sunday','Monday','Tuesday','Wednesday','Thursday'];
let current=0,solved=false,hinted=false,letters=[],checks=0;
function hm(n){n=((n%1440)+1440)%1440;return String(Math.floor(n/60)).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(n%60).padStart(2,'0')}
function dayText(n){const d=Math.floor(n/1440);return dayNames[d+1]+' '+(16+d)+' Nov'}
function full(n){return dayText(n)+' · '+hm(n)}
function offset(n){return 'UTC'+(n<0?'−':'+')+hm(Math.abs(n))}
function departure(){return Number($('day').value)*1440+Number($('time').value)}
function duration(n){return (n/60)+' hours'}
function progress(){const list=$('stamps');list.replaceChildren();missions.forEach((m,i)=>{const li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=i+1;li.className=i<letters.length?'done':i===current?'current':'';li.setAttribute('aria-label','Letter '+(i+1)+(i<letters.length?' delivered':i===current?' current':' waiting'));if(i===current)li.setAttribute('aria-current','step');list.append(li)});$('progress').textContent=letters.length+' of 6 delivered'}
function paint(){
 const m=missions[current],d=departure();
 $('clock').replaceChildren(document.createTextNode(hm(d)));const unit=document.createElement('small');unit.textContent='UTC';$('clock').append(unit);
 $('time').setAttribute('aria-valuetext',hm(d)+' UTC on '+dayText(d));
 $('departureLabel').textContent='That is '+cities[m.from].name+' local departure';
 $('departure').textContent=full(d+cities[m.from].offset);
 $('back').disabled=d===0||solved;$('forward').disabled=d===2865||solved;
}
function changed(){if(solved)return;$('feedback').hidden=true;paint()}
function move(delta){let d=Math.max(0,Math.min(2865,departure()+delta));$('day').value=String(Math.floor(d/1440));$('time').value=String(d%1440);changed()}
function loadMission(focus=false){
 const m=missions[current];solved=false;hinted=false;checks=0;
 $('missionTitle').textContent=m.title;$('story').textContent=m.story;
 for(const key of ['from','to']){$(key).textContent=cities[m[key]].name;$(key+'Offset').textContent=offset(cities[m[key]].offset)}
 $('target').textContent=full(m.target);$('localTarget').textContent=cities[m.to].name+' local arrival';$('duration').textContent='Flight time: '+duration(m.flight)+'.';
 $('hintText').hidden=true;$('hint').setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');$('hint').textContent='Show a hint';$('cancel').hidden=true;$('feedback').hidden=true;$('next').hidden=true;
 for(const id of ['day','time','check','hint'])$(id).disabled=false;
 $('day').value='0';$('time').value='720';paint();progress();
 if(focus){$('missionTitle').focus();$('game').scrollIntoView({block:'start',behavior:'instant'})}
}
$('time').addEventListener('input',changed);$('day').addEventListener('change',changed);
$('back').addEventListener('click',()=>move(-15));$('forward').addEventListener('click',()=>move(15));
$('hint').addEventListener('click',()=>{
 const m=missions[current],open=$('hintText').hidden;
 if(open)hinted=true;
 const utc=m.target-cities[m.to].offset,answer=utc-m.flight;
 $('hintText').textContent=m.theme+' '+cities[m.to].name+' '+hm(m.target)+' is '+full(utc)+' UTC. Subtract the '+duration(m.flight)+' flight: depart '+full(answer)+' UTC.';
 $('hintText').hidden=!open;$('hint').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));$('hint').textContent=open?'Hide the hint':'Show a hint';
});
$('check').addEventListener('click',()=>{
 if(solved)return;
 const m=missions[current],d=departure(),arrival=d+m.flight+cities[m.to].offset,diff=arrival-m.target;checks++;
 $('feedback').hidden=false;$('feedback').className='feedback '+(diff===0?'good':'bad');
 $('arrival').textContent='Actual arrival: '+full(arrival)+' in '+cities[m.to].name+'.';
 if(diff===0){
  solved=true;letters.push({title:m.title,departure:d,arrival,hinted,checks});$('result').textContent='Right on time. Letter delivered!';
  $('cancel').hidden=false;$('cancel').className='stamp-in';$('next').hidden=false;$('next').textContent=current===5?'Open your postal log':'Next letter';
  for(const id of ['day','time','check','hint'])$(id).disabled=true;paint();progress();$('next').focus();
 }else{
  const a=Math.abs(diff),h=Math.floor(a/60),mins=a%60;
  const amount=[h?h+' '+(h===1?'hour':'hours'):'',mins?mins+' '+(mins===1?'minute':'minutes'):''].filter(Boolean).join(' and ');
  $('result').textContent='The letter arrives '+amount+' '+(diff>0?'late. Move the UTC departure earlier.':'early. Move the UTC departure later.');
 }
});
$('next').addEventListener('click',()=>{
 if(!solved)return;
 if(current<5){current++;loadMission(true);return}
 $('game').hidden=true;$('finish').hidden=false;
 const helpers=letters.filter(x=>x.hinted).length;
 $('summary').textContent='Six deliveries complete'+(helpers?', with a hint on '+helpers+(helpers===1?' letter.':' letters.'):'. All six solved without hints!');
 $('log').replaceChildren();
 letters.forEach((r,i)=>{const li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=(i+1)+'. '+r.title+': '+full(r.departure)+' UTC departure → '+full(r.arrival)+' local arrival.';$('log').append(li)});
 $('finishTitle').focus();$('finish').scrollIntoView({block:'start',behavior:'instant'});
});
$('replay').addEventListener('click',()=>{current=0;letters=[];$('game').hidden=false;$('finish').hidden=true;loadMission(true)});
loadMission();
</script>
</body>
</html>
